  "worked_solution": "To find the coordinates of the point $A,$ we start at the origin, move $1$ unit *left* and then $4$ units *up*. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14162111/assets/147aa8c644b24f82abadbbb9362ed51718bf94da992c83d016c72a1898032f0f.png)\n\nThe $x$-coordinate of $A$ is $-1,$ the $y$-coordinate is $4,$ and coordinates are given by the ordered pair $(-1,4).$",
